@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam BorderColor #4A5568
skinparam BackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #A67C00
title Database architecture
component "Plugin task" as Plugin
component "JDBC repository" as Repository
component "DatabaseResourceManager" as Manager
component "SQLServerResource" as Resource
component "Apache Commons DBCP pool" as Pool
database "SQL Server: OpenData" as SQL
Plugin --> Repository
Repository --> Manager : getConnection()
Manager <|.. Resource
Resource --> Pool
Pool --> SQL : physical JDBC sessions
note right of Repository
One borrowed connection per transaction.
Closing returns it to the pool.
end note
@enduml
